From 03e005f983f71a398dac5d8800112110df1d0b49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c <c@c>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 04:33:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] =?UTF-8?q?wizard:=20full=20i18n=20(it/en)=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20thread=20lang=20via=20context,=20translate=20all=20steps?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Nuovo Sito wizard was never internationalized: every step hardcoded
Italian and lang was not threaded, so selecting English still showed Italian.
Adds a WizardI18nProvider/useT context (built from the cookie lang on the
server page), routes lang from the page into WizardContainer, and replaces
all hardcoded strings across the 11 steps + StepNav with i18n keys. Adds the
wizard.* dictionaries (it + en, 344 keys each). Persisted enum values
(industry, voice traits, palette/font ids) stay canonical; only display is
translated. tsc --noEmit clean.
---
